WEBVTT

00:00:04.132 --> 00:00:06.692
This is going to be harder than I thought.

00:00:10.492 --> 00:00:11.612
MIKE: Okay! Listen up, Oozmas.

00:00:11.972 --> 00:00:13.932
Now, we're going to have to start
winning these things together,

00:00:14.452 --> 00:00:15.732
so that means I'm going to need

00:00:15.812 --> 00:00:17.452
each of you guys
to pull your own weight.

00:00:17.572 --> 00:00:18.732
-Mike?
-(GASPS) What is it?

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:21.132
We've made a list of
our strengths and weaknesses.

00:00:21.212 --> 00:00:24.372
In high school, I was
the master of the silent scare.

00:00:24.532 --> 00:00:26.492
I could sneak up on a field mouse

00:00:26.572 --> 00:00:28.892
-in a pillow factory.
-(SQUISHING)

00:00:28.972 --> 00:00:31.252
Sorry! They get stickier
when I'm sweaty.

00:00:32.212 --> 00:00:33.972
Oh, my gosh, that's terrible.

00:00:34.052 --> 00:00:37.332
We're experts in the ancient craft
of close-up magic.

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:42.252
It's all about misdirection.

00:00:43.732 --> 00:00:46.412
-Uh...
-I have an extra toe. (LAUGHS)

00:00:46.492 --> 00:00:47.652
Not with me, of course.

00:00:48.452 --> 00:00:51.092
Guys, one slip-up on the next event,
and we're goners.

00:00:51.172 --> 00:00:52.292
So for this to work,

00:00:52.372 --> 00:00:55.012
I'm gonna need you
to take every instinct you have

00:00:55.092 --> 00:00:56.612
and bury it deep, deep down.

00:00:56.932 --> 00:00:59.012
-Done.
-From now on, we are of one mind.

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:00.092
My mind.

00:01:00.252 --> 00:01:01.252
Oh, please.

00:01:01.492 --> 00:01:03.412
I will tell you exactly what to do,
and how to do it.

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:05.692
ALL: Uh... Okay, Mike.
Seems about right.

00:01:05.972 --> 00:01:07.292
All right. Give me scary steps.

00:01:07.412 --> 00:01:09.252
Fifty up and down, right now. Let's go!

00:01:09.332 --> 00:01:12.012
You're wasting your time.
We need a new team.

00:01:12.092 --> 00:01:14.852
(SCOFFS) We can't just
"get a new team"!

00:01:14.932 --> 00:01:16.372
I checked this morning.
It's against the rules.

00:01:16.812 --> 00:01:18.612
What if we disguised a new team
to look like the old team?

00:01:18.932 --> 00:01:20.532
Oh, no, no. We are not cheating.

00:01:20.852 --> 00:01:23.012
It's not cheating. I'm just, you know,

00:01:23.132 --> 00:01:24.412
leveling the playing field.

00:01:26.332 --> 00:01:28.692
Okay, so it's kind of cheating,
but what do you want me to do?

00:01:28.772 --> 00:01:30.332
They're not exactly
the scariest group in the world.

00:01:31.092 --> 00:01:34.052
Oh, a ladybug!
Make a wish! Make a wish!

00:01:34.692 --> 00:01:36.252
-(BLOWS)
-(ALL CHUCKLING)

00:01:37.972 --> 00:01:39.372
This is not going to work.

00:01:39.452 --> 00:01:41.092
Where are you going? We're training.

00:01:41.172 --> 00:01:42.212
I'm a Sullivan.

00:01:42.532 --> 00:01:44.372
That's not enough.
You're all over the place.

00:01:44.452 --> 00:01:45.492
You're charging ahead when you...

00:01:45.812 --> 00:01:46.812
Bup, bup, bup!

00:01:46.892 --> 00:01:49.132
You tell them what to do but not me.

00:01:49.212 --> 00:01:50.852
So long, Coach.

00:01:51.812 --> 00:01:53.452
-(CLICKS TONGUE)
-(BOTH GIGGLING)

00:01:54.812 --> 00:01:56.212
Okay, Oozmas... (GASPS)

00:01:56.852 --> 00:01:58.212
Boy, we need to get you a bell.

00:01:58.292 --> 00:02:01.892
Listen up. "If a kid hears you coming,
they'll call Mom or Dad,

00:02:01.972 --> 00:02:03.972
"then you'd better run fast
or things will get bad."

00:02:04.412 --> 00:02:05.412
Huh?

00:02:05.612 --> 00:02:07.412
In the next event,
if even one of us gets caught,

00:02:07.492 --> 00:02:09.092
we're all out.

00:02:09.172 --> 00:02:11.812
So remember, do exactly what I do.

00:02:21.812 --> 00:02:23.692
FEMALE ANNOUNCER: We are at
the halfway point of the second event,

00:02:24.252 --> 00:02:26.612
and things are getting interesting.

00:02:30.292 --> 00:02:31.532
(SOFTLY) Got it.

00:02:32.692 --> 00:02:33.852
FEMALE ANNOUNCER:
Only two teams left.

00:02:34.612 --> 00:02:36.292
Who will make it out with their flag,

00:02:36.372 --> 00:02:37.932
and who will be eliminated?

00:02:38.012 --> 00:02:39.012
MALE ANNOUNCER: In a real Scare,

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:41.692
you do not want to get caught
by a kid's parent.

00:02:41.772 --> 00:02:44.892
And in this event,
you do not want to get caught by

00:02:45.212 --> 00:02:46.492
the librarian.

00:02:47.172 --> 00:02:48.212
(SHUSHING)

00:02:49.652 --> 00:02:51.372
Quiet.

00:02:53.612 --> 00:02:55.612
(SCOFFS) What's so scary
about a little old librarian?

00:02:56.772 --> 00:02:58.012
-(CHAIR CREAKS)
-(GASPS)

00:03:05.212 --> 00:03:07.492
I said, "Quiet."

00:03:08.532 --> 00:03:10.372
(SCREAMING)

00:03:11.572 --> 00:03:12.572
(GRUNTS)

00:03:13.132 --> 00:03:14.412
(ALL LAUGHING)

00:03:14.692 --> 00:03:15.692
(GASPING)

00:03:19.372 --> 00:03:20.492
(WHIMPERS)

00:03:31.892 --> 00:03:33.772
-Faster.
-Slow and steady.

00:03:33.892 --> 00:03:35.652
-Slow and steady.
-Slow and steady.

00:03:35.732 --> 00:03:36.772
BOTH: Slow and steady.

00:03:37.012 --> 00:03:38.532
Slow and steady.

00:03:42.932 --> 00:03:44.252
(GRUNTS IN ANNOYANCE)

00:03:55.692 --> 00:03:56.692
(GASPS)

00:03:58.132 --> 00:03:59.132
-Sullivan!
-Sullivan!

00:03:59.252 --> 00:04:00.212
-Sullivan!
-Sullivan!

00:04:00.292 --> 00:04:01.332
(ALL SHUSHING)

00:04:01.412 --> 00:04:02.452
(ALL GROANING)

00:04:05.572 --> 00:04:06.612
(FLOORBOARD CREAKS)

00:04:06.932 --> 00:04:07.932
(GASPS)

00:04:08.692 --> 00:04:09.772
Hmm.

00:04:15.972 --> 00:04:17.612
Whew! (GASPS)

00:04:20.852 --> 00:04:21.852
(GRUNTS)

00:04:23.652 --> 00:04:24.612
(GASPING)

00:04:25.652 --> 00:04:27.172
(STRAINING) Ooh!

00:04:28.532 --> 00:04:29.692
(GRUNTS)

00:04:31.692 --> 00:04:33.412
-(GROWLS)
-(GASPS)

00:04:38.732 --> 00:04:40.412
-No!
-(POPPING)

00:04:44.892 --> 00:04:46.132
(GROWLING)

00:04:48.652 --> 00:04:51.252
TERRI: Five, six, seven, eight!
(SCATTING)

00:04:51.332 --> 00:04:52.452
BOTH: Look over here!

00:04:52.932 --> 00:04:54.412
-(TERRY CHUCKLING)
-(TERRI SINGING)

00:04:55.572 --> 00:04:57.812
-(LAUGHING)
-(PLATES SHATTERING)

00:04:59.172 --> 00:05:01.172
-Is that legal?
-You better believe it, mop top!

00:05:01.332 --> 00:05:03.372
The only rule is don't get caught.

00:05:03.772 --> 00:05:05.132
(CONTINUES LAUGHING)

00:05:06.612 --> 00:05:07.692
Whoo!

00:05:07.932 --> 00:05:09.052
(LAUGHING)

00:05:10.012 --> 00:05:11.652
-(GASPS)
-(ALL GRUNTING)

00:05:14.132 --> 00:05:15.572
-Ooh!
-BOTH: Hey! Over here!

00:05:16.012 --> 00:05:17.452
(GROWLS)

00:05:17.532 --> 00:05:18.932
(SCREAMS)

00:05:19.132 --> 00:05:20.692
-Come and get me!
-Come and get me! Whoo-hoo!

00:05:20.772 --> 00:05:21.812
Guys, what are you doing?

00:05:21.892 --> 00:05:23.092
They said don't let her catch you.

00:05:23.172 --> 00:05:24.692
But they didn't say how!

00:05:24.972 --> 00:05:26.252
Move it! Move it! Move it! Come on!

00:05:26.412 --> 00:05:27.412
(GROWLS)

00:05:27.692 --> 00:05:28.692
(ALL SCREAM)

00:05:30.892 --> 00:05:31.892
ALL: Whoa!

00:05:32.532 --> 00:05:33.532
(ALL GRUNT)

00:05:33.612 --> 00:05:34.612
Whew! (CHUCKLES)

00:05:34.692 --> 00:05:35.692
We did it!

00:05:35.892 --> 00:05:38.492
No, we didn't. We forgot the flag!

00:05:38.572 --> 00:05:40.012
-SQUISHY: Mike?
-(GASPS)

00:05:42.332 --> 00:05:44.052
-Way to go, Squishy!
-Way to go, Squishy!

00:05:44.292 --> 00:05:45.372
How?

00:05:45.532 --> 00:05:47.452
Misdirection.

00:05:48.372 --> 00:05:49.572
(LIBRARIAN GROWLS)

00:05:50.092 --> 00:05:51.252
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:05:52.812 --> 00:05:53.852
(ALL CHEERING)

00:05:53.932 --> 00:05:55.932
The EEKs have been eliminated

00:05:56.012 --> 00:05:59.932
and Oozma Kappa live
to scare another day!

00:06:00.012 --> 00:06:03.332
ALL: (CHANTING)
We're OK! We're OK! We're OK!

00:06:07.692 --> 00:06:09.252
SQUISHY: I've never felt so alive!

00:06:09.332 --> 00:06:10.452
TERRI: We were awesome!

00:06:10.532 --> 00:06:12.732
Okay, look. That wasn't real Scaring.

00:06:13.172 --> 00:06:14.412
It was better than what you did.

00:06:14.492 --> 00:06:15.892
You should've stuck to my strategy.

00:06:16.252 --> 00:06:17.212
Whatever.

00:06:17.292 --> 00:06:18.972
Talk to me when we start
the real Scaring.

00:06:19.452 --> 00:06:20.492
(CAR HORN HONKS)

00:06:20.572 --> 00:06:22.892
Hey! You guys going to the party?

00:06:23.292 --> 00:06:25.052
Oh, I think you've got the wrong guys.

00:06:25.132 --> 00:06:27.092
-We don't get invited to...
-(SHUSHES) Party?

00:06:27.172 --> 00:06:28.972
The mid-games mixer at the RORs'.

00:06:29.052 --> 00:06:31.052
-It's for the top Scare Teams.
-(POP MUSIC PLAYING ON RADIO)

00:06:31.132 --> 00:06:32.252
You're one of us now, right?

00:06:33.732 --> 00:06:34.812
See you there!

00:06:34.892 --> 00:06:36.012
(ALL GIGGLING)

00:06:36.092 --> 00:06:38.092
-Did you hear that?
-I can't believe it!

00:06:38.172 --> 00:06:40.012
-Uh-uh. Bad idea.
-This is great.

00:06:40.092 --> 00:06:42.932
They're finally seeing us as real Scarers.
We're going!

00:06:45.092 --> 00:06:46.092
(DANCE MUSIC PLAYING)

00:06:47.052 --> 00:06:48.852
DON: Do young people still dance?

00:06:49.252 --> 00:06:50.652
Because my moves are a little rusty.

00:06:50.732 --> 00:06:52.572
Oh, we forgot to bring a hostess gift.

00:06:52.652 --> 00:06:54.372
We can't go in there
without some scented candles.

00:06:54.652 --> 00:06:57.172
Calm down. We earned this.

00:06:57.492 --> 00:06:59.252
(STAMMERS) What if there's
a lull in the conversation?

00:06:59.332 --> 00:07:01.332
I never know what to... You know...

00:07:01.572 --> 00:07:02.572
Say?

00:07:02.772 --> 00:07:04.172
How are you so good at this?

00:07:04.372 --> 00:07:06.372
You just took on
an angry 50-foot librarian,

00:07:06.452 --> 00:07:08.372
and you're afraid of a little party?

00:07:08.452 --> 00:07:09.652
Take a deep breath...

00:07:09.892 --> 00:07:10.892
(ALL INHALING DEEPLY)

00:07:11.092 --> 00:07:12.132
...and in you go!

00:07:17.132 --> 00:07:18.172
(MUSIC STOPS)

00:07:20.812 --> 00:07:21.852
Hello.

00:07:22.492 --> 00:07:24.732
-It's Oozma Kappa!
-These guys are crazy!

00:07:24.812 --> 00:07:26.972
What you did today was insane!

00:07:27.052 --> 00:07:28.212
MONSTER: That was awesome!

00:07:28.652 --> 00:07:29.972
(ALL CHATTERING INDISTINCTLY)

00:07:32.612 --> 00:07:35.372
Oozma Kappa,
tonight we party like Scarers!

00:07:35.452 --> 00:07:36.452
(ALL CHEER)

00:07:36.812 --> 00:07:38.452
(DANCE MUSIC PLAYING)

